    <h1 class="page-title">Residences &amp; floor plans</h1>
    <p class="page-intro">Four private residences across Mansion Daisy and Mansion Jasmine.</p>
    <div class="detail-actions" style="margin-top:20px">
      <a class="btn btn-navy" href="/media/projects/yarzeh/The-Yarzeh-Mansions-Brochure.pdf" download>Download brochure</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="with-rail">
    <div>
      <section class="detail-section" id="residences" style="margin-top:0">
<p class="res-mansion">Mansion Daisy</p>
<article class="res-card reveal" id="daisy-i">
          <div class="res-head">
            <h3>Daisy I</h3><span class="res-type">Duplex</span>
            <span class="res-price">US$ 2,597,000</span>
          </div>
          <div class="res-specs">
            <span><b>520 m²</b> interior</span>
            <span><b>170 m²</b> garden</span>
            <span><b>4</b> master bedrooms</span>
            <span>Ground + first floor</span>
            <span><b>4</b> parking spaces</span>
          </div>
          <p>A grand garden duplex in Mansion Daisy. The ground floor gathers the family around a TV room and three master suites opening toward 170 m² of private lawn, while the first floor is made for hosting: twin salons, a fireplace, a full kitchen with island and a fourth master suite with walk-in closet.</p>
          <div class="plans open">
            <p class="plans-label">Floor plans</p>
            <div class="plan-row">
              <a class="plan-thumb" data-group="plans-daisy-i" href="/media/projects/yarzeh/plans/daisy-i-ground.jpg">
                <img src="/media/projects/yarzeh/plans/daisy-i-ground.jpg" alt="Daisy I ground floor plan, 210 m² with 170 m² garden" loading="lazy"><span>Ground floor · 210 m²</span>
              </a>
              <a class="plan-thumb" data-group="plans-daisy-i" href="/media/projects/yarzeh/plans/daisy-i-first.jpg">
                <img src="/media/projects/yarzeh/plans/daisy-i-first.jpg" alt="Daisy I first floor plan, 310 m²" loading="lazy"><span>First floor · 310 m²</span>
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="res-card reveal" id="daisy-ii">
          <div class="res-head">
            <h3>Daisy II</h3><span class="res-type">Triplex · Flagship</span>
            <span class="res-price">US$ 3,105,000</span>
          </div>
          <div class="res-specs">
            <span><b>610 m²</b> interior</span>
            <span><b>80 m²</b> garden</span>
            <span><b>162 m²</b> terraces</span>
            <span><b>4</b> master bedrooms</span>
            <span>Three levels + private lift</span>
            <span><b>4</b> parking spaces</span>
          </div>
          <p>The crown of Mansion Daisy. Three bedroom suites and a TV room open onto 162 m² of wraparound terraces, the floor above holds double salons, a garden and a chef's kitchen, and a private elevator rises to a rooftop master suite with its own kitchenette. Six hundred and ten square meters that live like a villa in the sky.</p>
          <div class="plans open">
            <p class="plans-label">Floor plans</p>
            <div class="plan-row">
              <a class="plan-thumb" data-group="plans-daisy-ii" href="/media/projects/yarzeh/plans/daisy-ii-ground.jpg">
                <img src="/media/projects/yarzeh/plans/daisy-ii-ground.jpg" alt="Daisy II ground floor plan, 245 m² with 162 m² of terraces" loading="lazy"><span>Ground floor · 245 m²</span>
              </a>
              <a class="plan-thumb" data-group="plans-daisy-ii" href="/media/projects/yarzeh/plans/daisy-ii-first.jpg">
                <img src="/media/projects/yarzeh/plans/daisy-ii-first.jpg" alt="Daisy II first floor plan, 245 m² with 80 m² garden" loading="lazy"><span>First floor · 245 m²</span>
              </a>
              <a class="plan-thumb" data-group="plans-daisy-ii" href="/media/projects/yarzeh/plans/daisy-ii-roof.jpg">
                <img src="/media/projects/yarzeh/plans/daisy-ii-roof.jpg" alt="Daisy II roof floor plan, 120 m² master suite" loading="lazy"><span>Roof suite · 120 m²</span>
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
          <a class="text-link" href="/projects/yarzeh-mansions/#gallery" style="margin-top:24px;display:inline-block">See the interior renders of Daisy II</a>
        </article>

        <p class="res-mansion">Mansion Jasmine</p>
<article class="res-card reveal" id="jasmine-i">
          <div class="res-head">
            <h3>Jasmine I</h3><span class="res-type">Duplex</span>
            <span class="res-price">US$ 2,214,000</span>
          </div>
          <div class="res-specs">
            <span><b>445 m²</b> interior</span>
            <span><b>140 m²</b> garden</span>
            <span><b>4</b> master bedrooms</span>
            <span>Ground + first floor</span>
            <span><b>4</b> parking spaces</span>
          </div>
          <p>A garden duplex in Mansion Jasmine. Three master suites and a family TV room share the garden level, stepping straight onto 140 m² of lawn, while the floor above unfolds into double salons with a fireplace, a formal dining space and a fourth master suite behind its walk-in closet.</p>
          <div class="plans open">
            <p class="plans-label">Floor plans</p>
            <div class="plan-row">
              <a class="plan-thumb" data-group="plans-jasmine-i" href="/media/projects/yarzeh/plans/jasmine-i-ground.jpg">
                <img src="/media/projects/yarzeh/plans/jasmine-i-ground.jpg" alt="Jasmine I ground floor plan, 205 m² with 140 m² garden" loading="lazy"><span>Ground floor · 205 m²</span>
              </a>
              <a class="plan-thumb" data-group="plans-jasmine-i" href="/media/projects/yarzeh/plans/jasmine-i-first.jpg">
                <img src="/media/projects/yarzeh/plans/jasmine-i-first.jpg" alt="Jasmine I first floor plan, 240 m²" loading="lazy"><span>First floor · 240 m²</span>
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="res-card reveal" id="jasmine-ii">
          <div class="res-head">
            <h3>Jasmine II</h3><span class="res-type">Triplex</span>
            <span class="res-price">US$ 2,138,000</span>
          </div>
          <div class="res-specs">
            <span><b>455 m²</b> interior</span>
            <span><b>62 m²</b> terrace</span>
            <span><b>4</b> master bedrooms</span>
            <span>Three levels + private lift</span>
            <span><b>4</b> parking spaces</span>
          </div>
          <p>The upper residence of Mansion Jasmine. Three master suites and a TV room open to a 62 m² terrace made for long evenings, a full salon floor with kitchen and dining sits above, and a private elevator carries you to a rooftop master retreat with kitchenette and bath.</p>
          <div class="plans open">
            <p class="plans-label">Floor plans</p>
            <div class="plan-row">
              <a class="plan-thumb" data-group="plans-jasmine-ii" href="/media/projects/yarzeh/plans/jasmine-ii-ground.jpg">
                <img src="/media/projects/yarzeh/plans/jasmine-ii-ground.jpg" alt="Jasmine II ground floor plan, 180 m² with 62 m² terrace" loading="lazy"><span>Ground floor · 180 m²</span>
              </a>
              <a class="plan-thumb" data-group="plans-jasmine-ii" href="/media/projects/yarzeh/plans/jasmine-ii-first.jpg">
                <img src="/media/projects/yarzeh/plans/jasmine-ii-first.jpg" alt="Jasmine II first floor plan, 180 m²" loading="lazy"><span>First floor · 180 m²</span>
              </a>
              <a class="plan-thumb" data-group="plans-jasmine-ii" href="/media/projects/yarzeh/plans/jasmine-ii-roof.jpg">
                <img src="/media/projects/yarzeh/plans/jasmine-ii-roof.jpg" alt="Jasmine II roof floor plan, 95 m² master suite" loading="lazy"><span>Roof suite · 95 m²</span>
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>
      
      </section>
